{"html":"<p><strong><span><span><span>Giới thiệu môn học mới:</span></span><span><span>  </span></span><span><span>Toán, xác suất và thống kê trong kinh tế </span></span><span><span>(</span></span><span><span>Mathematics, </span></span><span><span>Probability and Statistics in Economics)</span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>Toán, xác suất và thống kê trong kinh tế </span></span><span><span>- TOA</span></span><span><span>108</span></span><span><span> (</span></span><span><span>Mathematics, </span></span><span><span>Probability and Statistics in Economics</span></span><span><span>-TOAE108)</span></span> <span><span>là học phần </span></span><span><span>bắt buộc</span></span><span><span> cho sinh viên chuyên </span></span><span><span>kinh tế chính trị quốc tế</span></span><span><span> (</span></span><span><span>Chương trình định hướng nghề nghiệp quốc tế</span></span><span><span>) do Bộ môn Toán xây dựng và </span></span><span><span>triển khai </span></span><span><span>giảng dạy </span></span><span><span>thành công cho Khoá 62, Kinh tế chính trị quốc tế</span></span> <span><span>ở </span></span><span><span>học kỳ </span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span> năm học 20</span></span><span><span>23</span></span><span><span>-20</span></span><span><span>24</span></span><span><span>.</span></span> <span><span>Môn học</span></span><span><span> này nhằm trang bị cho sinh viên những kiến thức cơ bản </span></span><span><span>thuộc nền tảng của toán cao cấp</span></span><span><span>, </span></span><span><span>xác suất </span></span><span><span>và </span></span><span><span>thống kê trong kinh tế, bao gồm:</span></span><span><span> Những nội dung cơ bản của Toán cao cấp ứng dụng trong kinh tế</span></span><span><span>:</span></span><span><span> ma trận, định thức, hệ phương trình tuyến tín</span></span><span><span>h</span></span><span><span> trong kinh tế, giải tích toán học trong kinh tế. </span></span><span><span>Những kiến thức cơ bản của xác suất </span></span><span><span>và </span></span><span><span>thống kê ứng dụng trong kinh tế: ước lượng tham số và kiểm định giả thuyết trong kinh tế, </span></span><span><span>phân tích tương quan và </span></span><span><span>mô hình hồi quy 2 biến trong kinh tế</span></span><span><span>.</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>Danh sách giảng viên giảng dạy môn học:</span></span></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<div>\n<p><span>STT</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div>\n<p><span>Tên giảng viên</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div>\n<p><span>Email</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div>\n<p><span>Điện thoại</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<div>\n<p><span>1</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div>\n<p><span>TS Phùng Duy Quang</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div>\n<p><a href=\"mailto:quangpd@ftu.edu.vn\"><span>quangpd@ftu.edu.vn</span></a></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<div>\n<p><span>2</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div>\n<p><span>TS Nguyễn Văn Minh</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div>\n<p><span>nguyenvanminh_math@ftu.edu.vn</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<div>\n<p><span>3</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div>\n<p><span>T</span><span>S Nguyễn Dương Nguyễn</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div>\n<p><span>duongnguyen</span><span>@ftu.edu.vn</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<div>\n<p><span>4</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div>\n<p><span>TS Hà Thị Thu Hiền</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div>\n<p><span>thuhienha504@ftu.edu.vn</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<div>\n<p><span>5</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div>\n<p><span>T</span><span>S Lâm Văn Sơn</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div>\n<p><a href=\"mailto:sonlam@ftu.edu.vn\"><span>sonlam@ftu.edu.vn</span></a></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<div>\n<p><span>6</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div>\n<p><span>ThS Phạm Ngọc Mai</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div>\n<p><a href=\"mailto:phamngocmai@ftu.edu.vn\"><span>phamngocmai@ftu.edu.vn</span></a></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<div>\n<p><span>7</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div>\n<p><span>ThS Vũ Thị Hương Sắc</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div>\n<p><span>huongsac@ftu.edu.vn</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<div>\n<p><span>8</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div>\n<p><span>ThS Phan Thị Hương</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div>\n<p><a href=\"mailto:phanhuong@ftu.edu.vn\"><span>phanhuong@ftu.edu.vn</span></a></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<div>\n<p><span>9</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div>\n<p><span>ThS Nguyễn Hữu Thịnh</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div>\n<p><a href=\"mailto:thinhnh@ftu.edu.vn\"><span>thinhnh@ftu.edu.vn</span></a></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span><span>Đề cương chi tiết</span></span><span><span> môn học</span></span><span><span> (<a href=\"https://khoacoban.ftu.edu.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/De-cuong-chi-tiet-hoc-phan-TOAN-XAC-SUAT-VA-THONG-KE-TRONG-KINH-TE-24.3.2023.pdf\"><strong><span>file đính kèm)</span></strong></a></span></span></p>","he":"<p><strong><span><span><span>Introducing a new course: Mathematics, Probability and Statistics in Economics</span></span><span><span>  </span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>Mathematics, Probability and Statistics in Economics - TOA108 (Mathematics, Probability and Statistics in Economics-TOAE108) is a compulsory course for students majoring in International Political Economy (International Career-Oriented Program), developed by the Department of Mathematics and successfully taught to cohort K62, International Political Economy, in semester 1 of the 2023-2024 academic year. The course equips students with foundational knowledge of advanced mathematics, probability and statistics in economics, including: Basic content of advanced mathematics applied in economics: matrices, determinants, systems of linear equations in economics, and mathematical analysis in economics. Basic knowledge of probability and statistics applied in economics: parameter estimation and hypothesis testing in economics, correlation analysis and the two-variable regression model in economics. </span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span> <span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span> <span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span> <span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>List of lecturers teaching the course:</span></span></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<div>\n<p><span>STT</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div>\n<p><span>Lecturer name</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div>\n<p><span>Email</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div>\n<p><span>Phone</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<div>\n<p><span>1</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div>\n<p><span>Dr. Phùng Duy Quang</span></p>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div>\n<p><a href=\"mailto:quangpd@ftu.edu.vn\"><span>quangpd@ftu.edu.vn</spa